  "notes": "FORMS:\n{精|せい} (precise, detailed) + {算|さん} (calculate) = precise calculation.\n\nWATCH OUT:\nDo not confuse with {生産|せいさん} (production, manufacturing) or {清算|せいさん} (liquidation, settling debts/relationships). {精算|せいさん} specifically refers to precise accounting and expense settlement.\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {精算|せいさん}{機|き}: fare adjustment machine (at train stations)\n- {精算|せいさん}{書|しょ}: expense report, settlement statement\n- {精算|せいさん}{所|じょ}: fare adjustment window\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {経費|けいひ}を{精算|せいさん}する: to settle expenses\n- {運賃|うんちん}を{精算|せいさん}する: to adjust the fare\n- {立替|たてかえ}{分|ぶん}を{精算|せいさん}する: to settle the amount advanced",
